              <calculation class='tableau' formula='SUM(IF MONTH([dteday]) = [Parameters].[Parameter 1724641372909591] THEN [cnt] END) &#13;&#10;/ &#13;&#10;COUNTD(IF MONTH([dteday]) = [Parameters].[Parameter 1724641372909591] THEN YEAR([dteday]) END)' />
            </column>
            <column caption='Simulated Rentals' datatype='real' name='[Calculation_1724641374724125]' role='measure' type='quantitative'>
              <calculation class='tableau' formula='MAX(&#13;&#10;  0,&#13;&#10;  [Calculation_1724641374449692] * (&#13;&#10;    1 &#13;&#10;    + [Parameters].[Parameter 1724641373773849] &#13;&#10;    + ([Parameters].[Parameter 1724641373995034] * [Parameters].[Parameter 1724641374261275])&#13;&#10;    + (&#13;&#10;      /* แปลงผลกระทบฤดูกาลอัตโนมัติจาก pMonth */&#13;&#10;      CASE [Parameters].[Parameter 1724641372909591]&#13;&#10;        WHEN 12 THEN -0.20 // ธ.ค. (Winter)&#13;&#10;        WHEN 1  THEN -0.20 // ม.ค. (Winter)&#13;&#10;        WHEN 2  THEN -0.20 // ก.พ. (Winter)&#13;&#10;        WHEN 3  THEN 0.00  // มี.ค. (Spring)&#13;&#10;        WHEN 4  THEN 0.00  // เม.ย. (Spring)&#13;&#10;        WHEN 5  THEN 0.00  // พ.ค. (Spring)&#13;&#10;        WHEN 6  THEN 0.15  // มิ.ย. (Summer)&#13;&#10;        WHEN 7  THEN 0.15  // ก.ค. (Summer)&#13;&#10;        WHEN 8  THEN 0.15  // ส.ค. (Summer)&#13;&#10;        ELSE 0.10          // ก.ย. - พ.ย. (Fall)&#13;&#10;      END&#13;&#10;    )&#13;&#10;  )&#13;&#10;)' />
            </column>
            <column caption='Rental Change (%)' datatype='real' name='[Calculation_1724641374830622]' role='measure' type='quantitative'>
              <calculation class='tableau' formula='IF ISNULL([Calculation_1724641374449692]) OR [Calculation_1724641374449692] = 0 THEN 0&#13;&#10;ELSE ([Calculation_1724641374724125] - [Calculation_1724641374449692]) / [Calculation_1724641374449692]&#13;&#10;END' />
            </column>
            <column aggregation='Sum' datatype='integer' name='[cnt]' role='dimension' type='ordinal' />
            <column datatype='date' name='[dteday]' role='dimension' type='ordinal' />
            <column-instance column='[Calculation_0807372781305872]' derivation='None' name='[none:Calculation_0807372781305872:nk]' pivot='key' type='nominal' />
            <column-instance column='[Calculation_1724641374830622]' derivation='User' name='[usr:Calculation_1724641374830622:qk]' pivot='key' type='quantitative' />
            <column aggregation='Sum' datatype='integer' name='[workingday]' role='dimension' type='ordinal' />
          </datasource-dependencies>
          <slices>
